### Environment Variables
# @token = <insert_jwt_token_here>

### Create a Listing
POST http://localhost:8082/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "2021 Porsche 911 Carrera",
  "make": "Porsche",
  "model": "911 Carrera",
  "year": 2021,
  "price": 42000000,
  "mileage": 13500,
  "condition": "used",
  "bodyType": "Coupe",
  "fuelType": "Petrol",
  "transmission": "Automatic",
  "color": "White",
  "doors": 2,
  "seats": 4,
  "engineSize": "3.0L",
  "drivetrain": "RWD",
  "features": ["Leather Seats", "Navigation System", "Parking Sensors"],
  "description": "Well-maintained 911 with full service history.",
  "location": "Colombo",
  "images": [
    "https://example.com/listings/1/img1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/listings/1/img2.jpg"
  ]
}

### Get All Listings
GET http://localhost:8082/api/listings?limit=10&page=1

### Search Listings (Make + Model + Price Filter)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/listings?make=Porsche&model=911%20Carrera&priceMax=50000000

### Get Featured Listings
GET http://localhost:8082/api/listings/featured

### Get Trending Listings
GET http://localhost:8082/api/listings/trending

### Get Brands List
GET http://localhost:8082/api/brands

### Get Models for Brand
GET http://localhost:8082/api/models?brand=Porsche

### Get Single Listing By ID
# @listing_id = <insert_id>
GET http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}

### View Listing (Increments view counter)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/view

### Update a Listing
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 41500000,
  "mileage": 14000
}

### Delete a Listing
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get My Postings
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/me/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Note: The following act on a target listing (Favorites & Repoots)

### Add Favorite
POST http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove Favorite
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get My Favorites
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/me/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report a Listing
POST http://localhost:8082/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "misleading",
  "details": "Mileage seems incorrect based on interior photos."
}
